 "notes": "Spine is a synthesis-verification chain (stepwise functional-group conversion evidenced by FTIR/NMR) feeding a property/qualification screen; weak structure→property link (hard/soft segment reasoning appears only in extracted mechanisms, not in the paper's own figures, so omitted). Feedback edge: OBS(photo) → DES/down_select (IPDI) is a design choice made AFTER observation — the spine is not strictly forward. Lost: chemical-resistance details, per-sample table values, VOC/biodegradability claims (asserted, not measured). Image-only: NCO band vanishing in PU (completion of reaction), MDI film defects, NMR b/e shift labels swapped vs text, C=C position 3010 vs text 3180. TGA 'PU-K3 most stable' and DSC 'G<K Tg' are not clearly readable from images — claims rest on text/table.",
 "migrated_from": "r01/graphs/Progress_in_Organic_Coatings__j.porgcoat.2015.05.014.json"
